    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can wield a melee weapon with such power that you can strike multiple times when you drop your opponents.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Attack\" title=\"Power Attack\">Power Attack</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +4.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> As the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a> Feat, except that you have no limit to the number of times you can use it per round.</p>",
